{
  "_comment": "获奖名单来源登记（award_ingest.py --seed 读取）。2026-11-23 来源普查结论：只登记「已亲手抓取验证可解析」的来源；扫描件/百度网盘/二维码一律不进，等人工或 OCR。",
  "sources": [
    {
      "competition_id": 17,
      "url": "http://www.ciscn.cn/upload/file/20260903/1788428135831218.xlsx",
      "title": "第十九届（2026）全国大学生信息安全竞赛（作品赛）决赛获奖名单（官方公布）",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "xlsx_sheet",
      "notes": "285 行 × 4 列，openpyxl 直读；公示版与公布版单元格逐格一致，只登公布版，避免重复计数。Rollback: 删 award_sources 行 + awards where source_url 为该 URL。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "sheet": "Sheet1",
        "header_row": 0,
        "columns": {
          "作品名称": "title",
          "参赛学校": "school",
          "奖项": "award_grade",
          "编号": "work_no"
        },
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第19届"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 13,
      "url": "https://www.cnsoftbei.com/content-1-1363-1.html",
      "title": "第十五届（2026）中国软件杯 全国总决赛一等奖获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "html_table",
      "notes": "正文 HTML 表格，7 列；「团队编号+队名」列按首个空格拆成队伍编号与作品名。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "columns": {
          "赛题编号": "topic",
          "学校": "school",
          "队长": "members",
          "队员1": "members",
          "队员2": "members",
          "指导教师": "advisor"
        },
        "split_first_space": {"团队编号+队名": ["team_code", "title"]},
        "group_by": {"key": ["team_code"], "concat": ["members", "advisor"]},
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第15届", "award_grade": "一等奖"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 13,
      "url": "https://www.cnsoftbei.com/content-1-1362-1.html",
      "title": "第十五届（2026）中国软件杯 全国总决赛二等奖获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "html_table",
      "notes": "139 行；空队员为 &nbsp;，解析后置空。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "columns": {
          "赛题编号": "topic",
          "学校": "school",
          "队长": "members",
          "队员1": "members",
          "队员2": "members",
          "指导教师": "advisor"
        },
        "split_first_space": {"团队编号+队名": ["team_code", "title"]},
        "group_by": {"key": ["team_code"], "concat": ["members", "advisor"]},
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第15届", "award_grade": "二等奖"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 13,
      "url": "https://www.cnsoftbei.com/content-1-1361-1.html",
      "title": "第十五届（2026）中国软件杯 全国总决赛三等奖获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "html_table",
      "notes": "443 行，页面约 299KB，必须整页下载解析（正文抽取器会截断）。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "columns": {
          "赛题编号": "topic",
          "学校": "school",
          "队长": "members",
          "队员1": "members",
          "队员2": "members",
          "指导教师": "advisor"
        },
        "split_first_space": {"团队编号+队名": ["team_code", "title"]},
        "group_by": {"key": ["team_code"], "concat": ["members", "advisor"]},
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第15届", "award_grade": "三等奖"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 7,
      "url": "https://www.fwwb.org.cn/attached/file/20260827/20260827105027_16.pdf",
      "title": "第十七届（2026）中国大学生服务外包创新创业大赛 全国赛获奖团队详细信息",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "103 页 13 列真表格；一队多行（合并单元格），必须 fill_down + group_by 按团队编号合并，否则 1479 队会写成 6446 条。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "columns": {
          "竞赛类别": "track",
          "奖项等级": "award_grade",
          "团队编号": "team_code",
          "团队名称": "title",
          "参赛报名院校": "school",
          "赛题名称": "topic",
          "成员姓名": "members",
          "指导老师": "advisor"
        },
        "fill_down": ["track", "award_grade", "team_code", "title", "school", "topic"],
        "group_by": {"key": ["team_code"], "concat": ["members", "advisor"]},
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第17届"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 10,
      "url": "http://jsjds.blcu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1825439128&wbfileid=088651D8A158F6C09AFA813354DE2433",
      "title": "2025年（第18届）中国大学生计算机设计大赛 评审结果公示名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2025",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "vsb9 站点：附件裸 GET 必撞「请输入验证码下载附件」，必须先 GET 文章页建会话 + 带 Referer，见 bootstrap_url/referer。189 页 8 列 3623 行。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "bootstrap_url": "http://jsjds.blcu.edu.cn/info/1043/2424.htm",
        "referer": "http://jsjds.blcu.edu.cn/info/1043/2424.htm",
        "columns": {
          "大类名称": "track",
          "拟评奖项": "award_grade",
          "作品编号": "work_no",
          "作品名称": "title",
          "省份": "province",
          "学校名称": "school",
          "作者": "members",
          "指导教师": "advisor"
        },
        "fixed": {"year": 2025, "session": "第18届"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 21,
      "url": "http://socoss.socchina.net/file/ueditor/image/20260824/f66b564847bb484388518923daf853ef.pdf",
      "title": "第九届（2026）全国大学生嵌入式芯片与系统设计竞赛 应用赛道全国总决赛获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "67 页电子版 PDF（有文字层），但合并单元格会把表抽成 9 列，故用 lines 模式：正则 ^编号 学校 队名$，奖项取段标题。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "lines",
        "row_regex": "^(?P<work_no>\\d{4,6})\\s+(?P<school>\\S+)\\s+(?P<title>\\S.*)$",
        "section_regex": "^(?:全国总决赛)?(一等奖|二等奖|三等奖|最佳工程奖|最佳创意奖)$",
        "dedupe_key": ["title", "school"],
        "fixed": {"year": 2026, "session": "第9届"}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 60,
      "url": "https://www.mcm.edu.cn/upload_cn/node/799/j7YmQFsf47493bfdf0368e34fb3dfa0f306cf934.pdf",
      "title": "2026 高教社杯全国大学生数学建模竞赛获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2026",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "45 页有文字层 PDF；这张表没有表头，列位固定（序号/组别/省份/学校/队员×3/指导教师），奖项只在「本科组二等奖」「高职高专组一等奖」这类段标题里，且首页（序号 1-21）是扫描图，故默认段=本科组一等奖。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "positional": ["seq", "group", "province", "school", "members", "members", "members", "advisor"],
        "section_regex": "((?:本科组|高职高专组)?(?:一等奖|二等奖|三等奖))",
        "section_default": "本科组一等奖",
        "title_template": "{school}·{members}",
        "dedupe_key": ["title", "school", "members"],
        "fixed": {"year": 2026}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 14,
      "url": "https://gitlab.eduxiji.net/csc1/nscscc/compiler2025/-/raw/main/2025年编译大赛全国总决赛获奖名单公告.pdf",
      "title": "2025 全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛 编译系统设计赛（华为毕昇杯）全国总决赛获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2025",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "2025 届有文字层（2026 届是扫描件，见 award_survey/cid-14.md）。5 页；p2 分 ARM/RISC-V 两段各带表头，p3 续页无表头（沿用上一张表头），p4 挑战赛道（表头首列是「赛题」）+ 外卡参赛队。奖项写「特等/一等/优胜」，由 grade 归一补「奖」字。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "columns": {
          "赛道": "track",
          "赛题": "track",
          "队伍名称": "title",
          "学校": "school",
          "队伍成员": "members",
          "奖项": "award_grade"
        },
        "dedupe_key": ["title", "school", "award_grade", "track"],
        "fixed": {"year": 2025}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 14,
      "url": "https://gitlab.eduxiji.net/csc1/csc-os/os2025/-/raw/main/2025年全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛操作系统设计赛全国总决赛获奖名单公告.pdf",
      "title": "2025 全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛 操作系统设计赛全国总决赛获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2025",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "5 页有文字层。p2 表头「序号|赛队名称|学校|赛队队员|奖项」，p3 续页无表头；p3 后半是「功能挑战赛道」另起一张表（表头写「排序|赛队队名|…」），两张表首列名不同，故 columns 同时登记两种写法。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "columns": {
          "序号": "seq",
          "排序": "seq",
          "赛队名称": "title",
          "赛队队名": "title",
          "学校": "school",
          "赛队队员": "members",
          "奖项": "award_grade"
        },
        "dedupe_key": ["title", "school", "award_grade"],
        "fixed": {"year": 2025}
      }
    },
    {
      "competition_id": 14,
      "url": "https://gitlab.eduxiji.net/csc1/csc-db/db2025/-/raw/main/2025年全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛数据库系统设计赛全国总决赛名单公告.pdf",
      "title": "2025 全国大学生计算机系统能力大赛 数据库管理系统设计赛全国总决赛获奖名单",
      "source_kind": "official_notice",
      "years": "2025",
      "adapter": "pdf_table",
      "notes": "4 页有文字层。6 列：队伍编号|队伍名称|学校|成员名单（合并跨 3 列）；奖项不做列，而是「一等奖/二等奖/三等奖」整行分段，故用 section_regex 取段标题；合并表头导致列位不可靠，改 positional。",
      "parse_spec": {
        "mode": "table",
        "positional": ["team_code", "title", "school", "members", "members", "members"],
        "section_regex": "^(一等奖|二等奖|三等奖|优胜奖)$",
        "dedupe_key": ["title", "school", "award_grade"],
        "fixed": {"year": 2025}
      }
    }
  ]
